  "html": "<main class=\"sfw-testimonials-single\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__inner\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__toolbar\">\n<p class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__back\">\n<a class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__back-btn\" href=\"https://new.soilfoodweb.com/#stories\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t← Back\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n</p>\n<nav aria-label=\"More testimonials\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__adjacent\">\n<a aria-label=\"Previous: Marcus Thorne\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__nav-btn\" href=\"https://new.soilfoodweb.com/testimonial/marcus-thorne/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPrevious\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n<p aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__counter\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t6 of 8\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n<a aria-label=\"Next: Yuki Tanaka\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__nav-btn\" href=\"https://new.soilfoodweb.com/testimonial/yuki-tanaka/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNext\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__layout\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__aside\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__photo-wrap\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__placeholder sfw-testimonials__initials\"><span class=\"sfw-testimonials__initials-text\">NH</span></span> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__content\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__pills\">\n<span class=\"sfw-testimonials-pill\">Certified SFW Lab-Tech</span>\n</div>\n<h1 class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__name\">Norman Higgins</h1>\n<p class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__country\">New Zealand</p>\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__body\">\n<p>I have spend the last 5 years or so soaking up every bit of knowledge I could find on healthy soil life. It is only since I started the SFW Foundation Courses that I feel I am no longer living off scraps I could source on the internet and I can finally get to the meat!</p>\n<p>I am so excited to continue this amazing journey as I unlearn 30 years of agrochemical farming and move down the regenerative path to biological understanding.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>"
 },
