  "title": "Zoë Unruh",
  "menu_order": 0,
  "html": "<main class=\"sfw-testimonials-single\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__inner\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__toolbar\">\n<p class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__back\">\n<a class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__back-btn\" href=\"https://new.soilfoodweb.com/#stories\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t← Back\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n</p>\n<nav aria-label=\"More testimonials\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__adjacent\">\n<a aria-label=\"Previous: Yuki Tanaka\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__nav-btn\" href=\"https://new.soilfoodweb.com/testimonial/yuki-tanaka/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPrevious\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n<p aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__counter\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t8 of 8\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n<a aria-label=\"Next: Amara Okafor\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__nav-btn\" href=\"https://new.soilfoodweb.com/testimonial/amara-okafor/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNext\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__layout\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__aside\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__photo-wrap\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__placeholder sfw-testimonials__initials\"><span class=\"sfw-testimonials__initials-text\">ZU</span></span> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__content\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__pills\">\n<span class=\"sfw-testimonials-pill\">Foundation Courses Student</span>\n</div>\n<h1 class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__name\">Zoë Unruh</h1>\n<p class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__country\">Canada</p>\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__body\">\n<p>I recently completed my foundation classes through a scholarship and I just wanted to say thank you so much for allowing me to participate in a class that otherwise would have never been accessible to me.<br/>\nI had so much fun learning about regenerative agriculture, creating compost and liquid amendments, and all the little creatures that help our soils to thrive. I am super excited to put all these ideas into practice and to continue learning!<br/>\nHopefully I can pay it forward by helping others to create healthy gardens, and eventually help provide more local food security to my community as we slowly build our property.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>"
 },
