  "html": "<main class=\"sfw-testimonials-single\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__inner\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__toolbar\">\n<p class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__back\">\n<a class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__back-btn\" href=\"https://new.soilfoodweb.com/#stories\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t← Back\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n</p>\n<nav aria-label=\"More testimonials\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__adjacent\">\n<a aria-label=\"Previous: Amara Okafor\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__nav-btn\" href=\"https://new.soilfoodweb.com/testimonial/amara-okafor/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPrevious\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n<p aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__counter\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2 of 8\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n<a aria-label=\"Next: John Doe\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__nav-btn\" href=\"https://new.soilfoodweb.com/testimonial/john-doe/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNext\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__layout\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__aside\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__photo-wrap\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__photo wp-post-image\" height=\"669\" src=\"https://new.soilfoodweb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wes-Sander-headshot.jpg\" width=\"669\"/> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__content\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__pills\">\n<span class=\"sfw-testimonials-pill\">Scholarship Student</span>\n</div>\n<h1 class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__name\">David Vance</h1>\n<p class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__country\">Canada</p>\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__body\">\n<p>What sets this apart from other platforms is how actionable the content is. There is zero fluff. Each module delivers direct, real-world strategies that you can implement in your projects immediately. The instructors are clearly industry experts who know what works today, not five years ago. My team’s productivity has spiked by 40% since we began implementing their workflows.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>"
 },
