  "html": "<main class=\"sfw-testimonials-single\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__inner\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__toolbar\">\n<p class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__back\">\n<a class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__back-btn\" href=\"https://new.soilfoodweb.com/#stories\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t← Back\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n</p>\n<nav aria-label=\"More testimonials\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__adjacent\">\n<a aria-label=\"Previous: David Vance\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__nav-btn\" href=\"https://new.soilfoodweb.com/testimonial/david-vance/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPrevious\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n<p aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__counter\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t3 of 8\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n<a aria-label=\"Next: Kyle Babcock\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__nav-btn\" href=\"https://new.soilfoodweb.com/testimonial/kyle-babcock/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNext\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__layout\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__aside\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__photo-wrap\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__photo wp-post-image\" height=\"576\" src=\"https://new.soilfoodweb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ctpfw-student-squeezing-compost-1-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__content\">\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__pills\">\n<span class=\"sfw-testimonials-pill\">Scholarship Student</span>\n</div>\n<h1 class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__name\">John Doe</h1>\n<p class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__country\">United Kingdom</p>\n<div class=\"sfw-testimonials-single__body\">\n<p>Enrolling in this course completely changed my career trajectory. The step-by-step guidance, practical assignments, and active community provided me with the tools I needed to launch my independent consulting business. I went from feeling stuck in my 9-to-5 to fully booked with clients within three months of graduating. The return on investment has been absolutely incredible, and I cannot recommend this program highly enough to anyone looking to make a serious move.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>"
 }
